    "lyrics": [],
    "notes": "One part (Flute), G major, 20 bars.  Bar 2: second C#5 has no sign (carried within the bar).  Bar 3: C5 is natural with NO printed natural (barline cancels the C# of bar 2).  Bar 6: D5 with a parenthesised courtesy natural; bar 8: C5 with an unparenthesised courtesy natural.  Bar 9: F##5, G#5, then F#5 printed as natural+sharp, then F5 natural.  Bar 11: Bb4, Bbb4, Bb4 (natural+flat), Ab4.  Bars 13-16: chromatic scales (sharps up, flats down; E#4 in bar 13; F5 natural in bar 14 then a parenthesised courtesy sharp on F#5 in bar 15).  Bars 17-18: G#4 tied over the barline; the next G#4 in bar 18 carries its sharp again.  Bar 19: C#5 then C4 without sign (accidentals only bind their own octave, so C4 is natural) then C5 with a natural sign.  Courtesy accidentals are encoded as <accidental cautionary=\"yes\"> (with parentheses=\"yes\" where printed in parentheses)."
  },
